    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Part 19 inspected before/after order values with DML Snapshot. This time I exported those work records, imagining an audit requiring evidence of a user’s activity on a specific database."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "With period and user set in Audit Log Export, I found both reads and approved changes. The file contained SQL, outcomes, and the UUID identifying the related approval request."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Inspecting Available Export Fields"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In Audit → Reports → Audit Log Export, I clicked Create Task, named it ‘ACP Lab - Order change audit - 2026-11-09,’ and selected Query Audit."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "See Log Template and Description lists file fields and filter keys: name for user, connectionName for connection, actionType for operation. I could build filters while checking the definitions."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
