    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Defining scope during extraction simplifies review: for a specific task, only relevant records need to be collected."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
