      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Change record No.293 ran at 2026-11-09 00:17:13, SUCCESS, 69 ms, one row. Executed From was SQL_REQUEST; Workflow Request UUID identified the approval request."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
