    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In the same file, SELECT was WEB_EDITOR and UPDATE SQL_REQUEST, distinguishing ordinary web reads from approved execution."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
