    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Preparing evidence was straightforward: select period and user, filter the database activity, preview, and download. I did not need to transcribe SQL or outcomes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
